@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN
@sellerToken = REPLACE_WITH_SELLER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
@orderId = REPLACE_WITH_ORDER_UUID
@publicCode = VNT-ABC123

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Readiness (incluye PostgreSQL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Perfil autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Categorías públicas
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Catálogo público con búsqueda
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=labial&category=labiales&limit=20&offset=0

### Crear pedido en efectivo
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: checkout-demo-001

{
  "customerName": "Cliente de prueba",
  "customerPhone": "55550000",
  "paymentMethod": "CASH",
  "items": [
    {
      "variantId": "30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": "0.01"
    }
  ]
}

### Crear categoría (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cuidado de uñas",
  "slug": "cuidado-de-unas"
}

### Catálogo completo para administración
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/catalog
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Crear producto (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "name": "Producto de prueba",
  "description": "Datos ficticios"
}

### Crear variante (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/products/20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/variants
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "DEMO-NUEVO",
  "name": "Tono de prueba",
  "price": "99.99"
}

### Reclamar pedido (SELLER)
POST {{baseUrl}}/seller/orders/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "publicCode": "{{publicCode}}"
}

### Pedidos propios (SELLER)
GET {{baseUrl}}/seller/orders?status=PENDING&limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### Marcar efectivo recibido sin confirmar venta (SELLER)
POST {{baseUrl}}/seller/orders/{{orderId}}/cash-received
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### Pedidos generales pendientes (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders?status=PENDING&paymentStatus=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Verificar pago y confirmar venta (ADMIN)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/verify-payment
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "VERIFIED"
}

### Rechazar pago (ADMIN)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/verify-payment
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "REJECTED",
  "rejectionReason": "Comprobante ilegible"
}

### URL temporal del comprobante más reciente (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/payment-proof-url
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Cancelar pedido pendiente (ADMIN)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Cliente desistió"
}
